s until financing improves. Its 2027 capex plan was up 18%, so this is a direct failure of equity funding. (Source: pellham-offering.)\n- **Sector:** Two utility share offerings were cut back in size in Q3 2026. Equity markets are described as \"less receptive\". (Source: utility-credit.)\n- **Debt:** Debt is available but costlier. Bond spreads widened 30bp in Q3 to 165bp. Norvane Utilities, whose 2027 capex is up 12%, priced a C$1.1B bond comfortably. (Sources: utility-credit, utility-capex-2027.)\n- **Knock-on effect:** Pellham is the largest single buyer of grid equipment in Caldria, so its cuts will reduce demand for transformers and substations. (Source: utility-capex-2027.)\n\n**Limits:** The sources don't give Norvane's total funding need or any equity plans. They don't say how many offerings were cut back, or whether the market will reopen. The conclusion rests on one withdrawn deal and one reported cutback in two others, so it is directional, not a full sector assessment.","ttft_ms":2896,"type":"result","duration_ms":21451,"uuid":"96b46309-8318-409e-b480-484a67c6cbb2","ttft_stream_ms":2609,"time_to_request_ms":65,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":4,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":11,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":3,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":5,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":0,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":4,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":9,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":3,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":4},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":15,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":68,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":203,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":131,"process_rss_mib_result":203,"process_anon_mib_result":122,"process_peak_rss_mib":223,"process_cpu_ms_turn":663,"process_wall_ms_turn":21451,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":